# Agent routing (system wrapper)

**Repo entry:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md). **Do not** treat [docs/roadmap.md](../../docs/roadmap.md) as the queue.

**Hard gates:** [kanban-card-gates.mdc](kanban-card-gates.mdc) — kanban card required for implementation; valid frontmatter `labels` required.

## User mode

| Mode | Work source | Code / cards |
| ---- | ----------- | ------------ |
| **Agent** | Card named + **agent verb** — `implement`, `update`, `review and update`, `spawn`, `answer inquiry`, … | [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md); [kanban-card-gates.mdc](kanban-card-gates.mdc) §2 |
| **Ask-only** | `review …` card only, bare `@path`, no card, or no agent verb | Read-only — no file edits |

## Turn lifecycle

```text
START → agent-triage/SKILL.md (classify; card + label + prompt-verb gate; §1b on failure signals only)
WORK  → card Label Paths + Label Methods → prior lessons gate (feature/bug/agent/commit-issue)
        → Decisions / Corrective Action → implement
        → Review QA fix: **QA follow-up** + refresh Feature Areas / Label Paths / Label Methods
VERIFY → targeted pytest; pre-commit-pytest.sh before Review/commit
DONE  → user says card Done → lessons learned **only** for feature / bug / agent / commit-issue
        → inquiry Done: **no** lessons capture
        → build_lessons_index.py when lessons ran; curate feature-areas lesson_* when applicable
END   → agent-self-evaluation/SKILL.md + handoff block
```

**Implementation / fix / refactor:** edit **≥1** `.cursor/skills/*` and **≥1** `.cursor/rules/*.mdc` before handoff (different learnings — skill = workflow, rule = constraint).

## Kanban card type (read `labels` in frontmatter)

| Label | Rule | Agent plan section |
| ----- | ---- | ------------------ |
| `feature` | [kanban-feature-cards.mdc](kanban-feature-cards.mdc) | **Decisions** |
| `bug` | [kanban-bug-cards.mdc](kanban-bug-cards.mdc) | **Corrective Action** (not Decisions) |
| `commit-issue` | [kanban-commit-issue-cards.mdc](kanban-commit-issue-cards.mdc) | **Review** → Root Cause + Corrective Action; implement after user approval |
| `inquiry` | [kanban-inquiry-cards.mdc](kanban-inquiry-cards.mdc) | **Response**; spawn child cards when user approves; **no** Card Done lessons |
| `agent` | [kanban-agent-cards.mdc](kanban-agent-cards.mdc) | **Decisions**; user **Description** + **Feature Area** |
| **Invalid** (missing / `[]` / unknown) | [kanban-card-gates.mdc](kanban-card-gates.mdc) | **Stop** — user must fix `labels` |

Resolve **Feature Areas** (or agent card **Feature Area**) → **Label Paths** + **Label Methods** via `docs/feature-areas.yaml` before `in-progress`.

## Code style (Python)

All agent edits to `.py` / `.pyi` files must keep lines ≤ **100** characters (`pyproject.toml` `line-length = 100`). Pre-commit ruff fails on E501 — wrap strings, split imports, break call chains before commit.

