## Discovery budget

- **Kanban + Feature Areas** → `docs/lessons-index.yaml` area block + [agent-triage/reference.md](../skills/agent-triage/reference.md) § Lessons by area before broad `.devtool/features/done/` grep ([kanban-prior-lessons-gate.mdc](kanban-prior-lessons-gate.mdc))
- **Failure signals** (hook, pytest, UI wiring, handoff) → [agent-triage/SKILL.md](../skills/agent-triage/SKILL.md) §1b grep before broad reads
- **Governance edits** → [agent-triage/reference.md](../skills/agent-triage/reference.md) § Consistency matrix
- **Governance audit card** → [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § Periodic AGENTS.md governance audit ([AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) Classify quickly)
- **Classify signal rows** — keep [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) § Classify quickly, triage §1, and reference § Classify in sync
- **Grep** before opening `ui/main_window.py` or other large files
- After **3** full file reads → prefer grep or semantic search
- **No card or review-only prompt** → Ask-only — do not edit (Signature: `kanban-prompt-ask-vs-agent`)

## Handoff (last sections — every response)

1. **`### Files used`** — load order; role tags — see [agent-self-evaluation/SKILL.md](../skills/agent-self-evaluation/SKILL.md) §7
2. **`### Self-evaluation`** — include **Context load** and **AGENTS.md** freshness; `Skills updated:` and `Rules updated:` on implementation turns. See [agent-self-evaluation.mdc](agent-self-evaluation.mdc).

**[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md):** evaluate for staleness every turn; update when routing, card types, or handoff format changes.
